x86_64-windows  a class with virtual functions in a base that is not the first is refused by name for this target - MSVC emits two vftable symbols rather than one table in two parts, and that has been measured for Itanium only. Same reason thunk.notarget records, and the same refusal: what this case is about, an override found in a base after the first, is an Itanium question until that lands
